{en:"dialectical materialism",ph:"ˌdaɪəˈlektɪkl məˈtɪəriəlɪzəm",ru:"диалектический материализм",ex:"Dialectical materialism was the philosophical basis of Marxist thought.",lv:"C1",cat:"philosophy"},
